ges-to-my-personal-details" class="faqs-accordion__link" data-v-538ce356>How do I make changes to my personal details?</a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-1" data-v-538ce356 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-faq-links-1" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-faq-links-1" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-1-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-1-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Receiving a parcel</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-faq-links-1" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-faq-links-1" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-1-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs-accordion__body" data-v-538ce356><!--[--><a href="/the-parcel-was-delivered-damaged" class="faqs-accordion__link" data-v-538ce356>The parcel was delivered damaged</a><a href="/what-can-i-do-if-i-havent-received-my-parcel" class="faqs-accordion__link" data-v-538ce356>What can I do if