ordion__link" data-v-538ce356>What if my return hasn&#39;t been received?</a><a href="/returning-a-parcel/can-i-return-an-item-with-evri" class="faqs-accordion__link" data-v-538ce356>Can I return an item with Evri?</a><a href="/returning-a-parcel/what-time-will-the-courier-collect-my-return-parcel" class="faqs-accordion__link" data-v-538ce356>What time will the courier collect my return parcel?</a><a href="/returning-a-parcel/how-should-i-package-my-returns-parcel" class="faqs-accordion__link" data-v-538ce356>How should I package my returns parcel?</a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-3" data-v-538ce356 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-faq-links-3" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-faq-links-3" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-3-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-3-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>ParcelShops</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-faq-links-3" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-faq-links-3" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="faq-l